# CakePHP 5

Version-specific guidance for CakePHP 5.x (installed: {{ assist.packageVersion('cakephp/cakephp')|default('unknown') }}). Prefer the CakePHP 5 Book for exact API syntax.

## Dependency injection and commands

{% if assist.uses('cakephp/cakephp', '>=5.3') %}
- CakePHP 5.3+ supports `#[Configure]` attributes and `TableContainer` for DI wiring. Prefer these when the application already uses attribute-based container configuration.
{% endif %}
{% if assist.uses('cakephp/cakephp', '>=5.4') %}
- CakePHP 5.4+ console commands expose `$this->io` and `$this->args` on the command instance. Prefer them over older constructor/io injection patterns when writing new commands in this major.
{% endif %}

{% if assist.uses('cakephp/cakephp', '>=5.3') %}
