## CakePHP 5.3+ HTTP and controllers

- Use `RateLimitMiddleware` for request throttling instead of ad hoc rate-limit helpers when adding new limits.
- Prefer pagination sortable-field builders from CakePHP 5.3+ when defining sortable pagination fields.
@endscoped

@scoped(['src/Model/**', 'plugins/**/src/Model/**'])
## CakePHP 5.3+ ORM and queries

- Prefer `SelectQuery::projectAs()` when mapping query results to DTOs instead of hand-rolled hydration loops.
@endscoped

@scoped(['src/Cache/**', 'config/app.php', 'config/app_local.php'])
## CakePHP 5.3+ caching

- Redis Cluster cache engine and cache package events are available in 5.3+. Use them when the deployment topology requires cluster-aware caching.
@endscoped

@scoped(['tests/**'])
## CakePHP 5.3+ testing

- Prefer integration-test redirect assertion helpers introduced in 5.3+ when asserting redirects.
@endscoped
{% endif %}

